  partName: Rear Blade Shroud Right
  description: The Rear Blade Shroud Right is a ring-like component that surrounds
    the Rear Blade Right, providing a seal between the blade and the engine casing
    to prevent gas leaks and maintain pressure. Made from a high-temperature resistant
    material, it is designed to withstand the extreme conditions found at the rear
    of the engine. Its design is often similar to the Rear Blade Shroud Left, but
    with subtle differences to accommodate the unique conditions on the right side
    of the engine.
